    "A check digit in the machine-readable zone disagrees, so something was misread. Compare it against the document before saving.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "رقم تحقّق في المنطقة المقروءة آليًا غير متطابق، أي أن شيئًا قُرئ خطأً. قارنه بالمستند قبل الحفظ."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A check digit in the machine-readable zone disagrees, so something was misread. Compare it against the document before saving."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una cifra di controllo nella zona a lettura ottica non corrisponde: qualcosa è stato letto male. Confrontalo con il documento prima di salvare."
          }
        }
