            "value": "Fanno %@ a testa, divisi in %lld."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The balance left and the minimum payment. If you don't know the interest rate, leave it at zero.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "الرصيد المتبقي والحد الأدنى للقسط. إن لم تكن تعرف نسبة الفائدة، اتركها صفرًا."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il saldo residuo e la rata minima. Se non conosci il tasso, lascialo a zero."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The document's details stay. Only the image is deleted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تفاصيل المستند تبقى. تُحذف الصورة وحدها."
          }
